acceptance_criteria: Declared scenario outputs are reproducible; no external tracker reads or writes occur; missing scenarios are explicit coverage gaps.
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T20:13:38.212Z",codex-agent,"Plan: run a fixed, versioned scenario suite with a real local SDK in a fresh non-git workspace. Never accept a caller tracker path, client, command, script, or integration. Pin synthetic author and normalize observations instead of exposing generated ids or timestamps. Report selected and missing scenario coverage explicitly. Validate public tracker-copy immutability, behavioral reverts, targeted local checks and unchanged npm/Bun CI gates."
  "2026-10-21T20:20:15.955Z",codex-agent,"Implementation executes the shared installation handlers and real Task create/claim/start/close probes in a child with fresh HOME, no extensions, no git on PATH and telemetry opt-out. Expected bug-triage evidence refusal is verified by core error code plus unchanged open state. Four workflows run for all seven presets. Partial selections return explicit gaps, typed input/runtime refusals include remedies, and reports omit nondeterministic identifiers and diagnostics. Local typechecks and docstrings passed; canonical fleet ESLint passed using the existing sibling tool installation because this package omits optional lint peers. Full npm/Bun release gates are added to CI at unchanged coverage thresholds."
  "2026-10-21T20:26:34.493Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replacing the requested preset dispatch with the minimal indie-dev setup makes the all-bundled-presets regression fail immediately on bug-triage: expected missing-evidence closure refusal becomes a closed Task (3/4 matching observations). Restoring the requested handler passes. An execve trace exposed the pinned SDK init Git-discovery probe even with mergeFence disabled; simulation now initializes from SDK default settings and audited settings mutation instead. A fresh trace shows only the parent Node and isolated Node worker, with zero git invocations. The upstream init behavior is reported as an SDK gap, not changed here."
  "2026-10-21T20:26:55.257Z",codex-agent,"Public-data validation: confirmed repository visibility is public. Used a read-only, non-git copy of origin/main 2f13c43f732381cb0aef43156a631e46b4244636: 74 items (60 closed, 6 open, 5 in progress, 2 blocked, 1 canceled), 154 tracked files, 958151 bytes. Seven presets ran twice: 14 reports, 56/56 matching workflow observations, 7/7 byte-identical report pairs, zero changed source-copy files. Compact JSON reports are 691-790 bytes. Direct native Bun SDK smoke passed 4/4 bug-triage observations. Read-only copy write-probe was denied. Simulations use synthetic data and do not ingest the copied item contents."
  "2026-10-21T20:27:36.469Z",codex-agent,"Final targeted linked test run passed: 7 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, via pm test --run --progress (1/1 linked command passed). Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate (104 declarations) and canonical changed-file ESLint passed. The earlier focused coverage measurement reported 100% lines/branches/functions for the simulation and shared dispatcher; full unchanged source-scope coverage is delegated to CI. No local full release gate was run because the host is saturated."
  "2026-10-21T20:32:19.754Z",codex-agent,"CI verified implementation head b55bc3323636ebb87ff5694514c3698327131047: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-presets/actions/runs/39670779257 completed successfully. The simulation-release-gates job passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each 171/171 tests with zero failures/skips/cancellations and 100% lines/branches/functions across 18 required source files. Node 22/26 and Windows prepare jobs passed; CodeQL passed. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-presets/pull/148 is ready for review. Automated reviews remain unavailable/neutral/skipped rather than approval. Local strict health retains pre-existing global pm-github host-version skew; clean CI health passed. Releasing the claim, leaving the item in progress for orchestrator verification. No merge or release performed."
  "2026-10-21T20:34:26.204Z",codex-agent,"Published-host cross-check: pm CLI 2026.10.21 native help and installed SDK declarations expose no preset simulator; the context-relevance scenarios grade read ranking. Sibling source confirms pm-starter remains a capability scaffold and pm-lint judges authoring quality. The same four bug-triage workflow probes also passed 4/4 using the actual 2026.10.21 SDK. Dependency pins remain unchanged; coordinated tracker writes continue using the repository-pinned host."
  "2026-10-21T22:49:18.509Z",codex-agent,"PR 148 review round: fetched every unresolved review thread with every comment and the latest CodeRabbit review body. One thread remains: PRRT_kwDOSp_1PM6u-dq5, valid mutable action references plus checkout credential persistence. Latest review contains no Outside diff range or nitpick findings. Remote branch was already current and contains origin/main. Plan: pin current action versions to upstream-verified commit SHAs, fix the same class in the existing CI matrix and release workflow, disable credentials in read-only CI jobs, add targeted regressions and individual revert proofs, then use CI for unchanged npm/Bun release gates. No review replies, resolutions, merge or release."
  "2026-10-21T22:50:00.346Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof for PRRT_kwDOSp_1PM6u-dq5: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"every external\" tests/ci-workflow.test.ts fails with exit 1 and mutable-action assertion for each of 9 independent single-reference reverts (checkout, setup-node, setup-bun in CI matrix, simulation-release-gates and release job). node --test --test-name-pattern=\"every CI checkout\" tests/ci-workflow.test.ts fails with exit 1 for each of 2 independent removals of persist-credentials: false from the read-only CI jobs. Every mutation was restored in finally; restored tests pass 2/2, zero failures/skips/cancellations. Upstream git ls-remote verified checkout v7=3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1, setup-node v7=949feb2413d6458794dcd2491c4babbbce0c15c1, setup-bun v2.2.0=0c5077e51419868618aeaa5fe8019c62421857d6. Existing pinned action revisions are preserved. Self-review covered the complete PR diff and all workflow uses; fixed the same class in existing CI and release dependencies. No other same-class defects remain; latest review has no outside-diff/nitpick findings. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, YAML parsing and canonical changed-file ESLint passed. npm run build reproduced committed dist byte-for-byte. Dependency install completed without vulnerability findings; no local full release gates were run."
  "2026-10-21T22:50:14.920Z",codex-agent,"Targeted linked validation passed: pm test pm-ygsu --run --only-last --progress executed node --test tests/ci-workflow.test.ts tests/release-workflow.test.ts: 10/10 tests passed, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 1/1 selected linked command passed. The pre-existing simulation command was deliberately unselected because runtime sources are unchanged. Test-result tracking is disabled by project policy, so this comment records the measured result. No local test timeout occurred. Full release checks at unchanged thresholds are pending on the pushed CI head."
  "2026-10-21T22:54:06.792Z",codex-agent,"Review-round CI verified code head 657af5bd501cf541e9cd238879fd927cb26784b8: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-presets/actions/runs/39689472244 completed successfully. Full npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed 173/173 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 100% lines/branches/functions across all 18 required source files at unchanged thresholds. Node 22/26 matrix, Windows prepare and CodeQL also passed. The single valid unresolved thread PRRT_kwDOSp_1PM6u-dq5 is fixed, including nine pin reverts and two credential-setting reverts proved independently. No outside-diff or nitpick findings existed in the latest reviewed body. No local timeout or gate retry was needed. Releasing the claim and leaving this item in_progress for orchestrator verification; final receipt commit will also receive CI. No threads replied to/resolved, no merge, no release."
